	<item>
		<title>Say something</title>
		<link>/contact/</link>
		<pubDate>2026-08-30 12:00:00</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">/?p=103</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p class="prose__lead">One of us reads everything that comes in, usually within a day. If it is about an existing order, include the order number and it will be much faster.</p>
  <div class="twocol">
    <div>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Email</h2>
      <p><a class="link" href="mailto:hello@rexjewelz.com">hello@rexjewelz.com</a></p>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Instagram</h2>
      <p><a class="link" href="https://instagram.com/rexjewelz" rel="noopener">@rexjewelz</a>, where the new pieces go up first.</p>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">The studio</h2>
      <p>Miami, Florida. Visits by arrangement, since it is a working bench and not a shop.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Made to measure</h2>
      <p>Send the measurements from the fit page along with the piece you want and we will come back with a price and a date. Most requests are possible. The ones that are not, we will say so rather than take the money and hope.</p>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Stylists and press</h2>
      <p>We pull for shoots and we are quick about it. Tell us the shoot date and what you are dressing and we will send what fits the brief.</p>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Repairs</h2>
      <p>Send a photo of what went wrong and roughly when you bought it. Most things are fixable and most repairs are free.</p>
    </div>
  </div>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
		<wp:post_id>103</wp:post_id>
