	</item>
	<item>
		<title>Shipping and timing</title>
		<link>/shipping/</link>
		<pubDate>2026-08-30 12:00:00</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">/?p=105</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p class="prose__lead">Everything is made to order in Miami, so there is a short wait before anything moves.</p>
  <h2 class="prose__sub">How long it takes</h2>
  <p>Most pieces are made and shipped within 3 to 5 working days. Crystal pieces take longer because every stone is set by hand, usually 5 to 8 days. Anything made to measure takes about three weeks and we will tell you the date when we take the order.</p>
  <p>You get a tracking number the moment the label is made, not when the parcel is collected, so there can be a day where it exists but has not moved. That is normal and it is not a lost parcel.</p>
  <h2 class="prose__sub">What it costs</h2>
  <p>Shipping inside the United States is a flat $7, and free on orders over $95. Canada is $16. Everywhere else is $24.</p>
  <p>International orders can attract duties on arrival. Those are set by your country and there is no way for us to pay them in advance.</p>
  <h2 class="prose__sub">Where we ship</h2>
  <p>Worldwide, except anywhere our carrier will not insure. If checkout will not take your address, send us a message and we will usually find a way around it.</p>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
		<wp:post_id>105</wp:post_id>
		<wp:post_date><![CDATA[2026-08-30 12:00:00]]></wp:post_date>
